Consider the following incomplete method，which is intended to reverse the elements in an array．

For example，if the method is called with the following array

{|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|}
 5 & 8 & 3 & 7 & 4 & 6 & 2 

then，upon completion，the array should contain the following．

{|l|l|l|l|l|l|l|}
 2 & 6 & 4 & 7 & 3 & 8 & 5 

Which of the following can be used to replace／＊condition＊／and／＊expression＊／so that reverse will work as intended？
/* condition */ 1* expression */
